msgid ""
"You and your AI partner alternate turns describing and guessing words "
"without directly\n"
"          naming them. This encourages creative thinking and fluent "
"expression, adapting to your\n"
"          language proficiency."
msgstr ""
"Anda dan mitra AI Anda bergiliran mendeskripsikan dan menebak kata-kata "
"tanpa langsung\n"
"          menyebutkan mereka. Ini mendorong pemikiran kreatif dan ekspresi "
"lancar, menyesuaikan dengan kemampuan\n"
"          bahasa Anda."

#: src/features/Blog/Articles/phrases-for-an-interview.tsx:453
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"You answer questions just like in a real interview and get instant "
"feedback. The AI adapts the questions to your profession and experience. "
"This kind of training helps you identify weak spots, work on your "
"pronunciation, and learn how to handle unexpected questions calmly. You’ll "
"notice your speech becoming more fluent and your answers more polished with "
"each attempt."
msgstr ""
"Anda menjawab pertanyaan layaknya dalam wawancara sungguhan dan mendapatkan "
"umpan balik seketika. AI menyesuaikan pertanyaan berdasarkan profesi dan "
"pengalaman Anda. Pelatihan semacam ini membantu Anda mengidentifikasi "
"kelemahan, berlatih pengucapan, dan belajar cara menangani pertanyaan tak "
"terduga dengan tenang. Anda akan menyadari bahasa Anda menjadi lebih fasih "
"dan jawaban Anda semakin terasah setiap usaha Anda."

#: src/features/Case/data/frontend-junior/painSection.ts:16
